WEBVTT

00:00.840 --> 00:02.240
Chen Wan'er

00:02.320 --> 00:05.653
If you want to die, don't drag me with you

00:07.720 --> 00:08.320
Prince of Jin

00:08.480 --> 00:09.960
Found Prince of Jin

00:13.200 --> 00:14.120
Father

00:14.200 --> 00:14.840
Your son never thought

00:14.920 --> 00:16.840
To do such an absurd thing

00:17.440 --> 00:18.640
Father

00:18.720 --> 00:20.000
Our Sikong family's face

00:20.080 --> 00:21.840
Has been completely shamed by you

00:21.920 --> 00:23.640
Now you say you didn't mean it

00:23.720 --> 00:26.387
I'll kick you to death, you worthless thing

00:26.840 --> 00:27.760
Father

00:27.840 --> 00:29.640
Even if you gave your son a hundred times more courage

00:29.720 --> 00:31.840
Your son would never actively do such a foolish thing

00:31.960 --> 00:33.360
Get away

00:34.040 --> 00:34.840
Tomorrow

00:34.920 --> 00:35.880
No

00:35.960 --> 00:37.520
Pack your things today

00:37.600 --> 00:39.160
Go to the southern frontier

00:39.240 --> 00:40.640
Without my edict

00:40.720 --> 00:43.053
You may not leave even one step

00:44.360 --> 00:45.560
Yes

00:47.000 --> 00:53.000
That night, the emperor's decree ordering you to your fief reached your estate, banishing you to the southern frontier, forbidden to return without imperial summons.

00:53.600 --> 01:00.000
Your advisors urged you to obey the imperial decree and depart first, biding your time. Alas, en route to your fief, you crossed paths with a rebel uprising.

01:00.600 --> 01:07.500
They executed you on the spot under the pretext of treason, reporting it only after the deed was done.
